OL,3,GNEWSABBC Scotland TV channel to close
OL,4,Aamid cuts to services
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC has announced plans to close
OL,7,Fits Scotland linear TV station as it
OL,8,Fseeks to make #500m savings.
OL,10,FThe channel, which started in February
OL,11,F2019, will move to BBC iPlayer in
OL,12,Fspring next year, although its nightly
OL,13,FNews at Seven programme will close.
OL,15,FThe change is expected to see about 10
OL,16,Fposts cut in addition to the 60 BBC
OL,17,FScotland announced earlier this year.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
