OL,3,GNEWSABBC Scotland TV channel to close
OL,4,Aamid cuts to services
OL,5,
OL,6,FDirector of BBC Scotland, Hayley
OL,7,FValentine, said: "Against the backdrop
OL,8,Fof significant financial challenges, we
OL,9,Fmust focus our resources where they
OL,10,Fwill have the greatest impact for
OL,11,Faudiences."
